            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Pulso is now Firstlight.

- See when friends are at their computers and how their day went.
- Groups with invite links, friend requests and bumps.
- Choose what you share: apps and agent time, in detail, as a total, or not at all.
- Updates install on their own.

Your Pulso account still works: sign in with the same Google account. Activity and friends from Pulso are not carried over.
]]></description>
